<div class="container text-dark mb-5 mt-5">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-12">
            <div class="faqs-card">
                <h2 class="text-center find-us-on-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="col-md-6">
                        <div class="accordion accordion-flush" id="accordionQuestion">

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="accordionQuestionHeader0">
                                    <button class="accordion-button fs-15 fw-normal collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionQuestionBody0">
                                        Where is the best bespoke suit tailor in Hanoi?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="accordionQuestionBody0">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        At Unlim Tailor, we are widely regarded as one of the best bespoke suit tailors in Hanoi.
                                        Our clients include politicians, statesmen, and business leaders who trust us to perfect their image.
                                        We don't mass-produce—we handcraft each suit with meticulous care, precision, and a deep understanding of the responsibility our clients bear.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="accordionQuestionHeader1">
                                    <button class="accordion-button fs-15 fw-normal collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionQuestionBody1" aria-expanded="false">
                                        Are there any good tailors in Hanoi's Old Quarter?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="accordionQuestionBody1">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        While Hanoi's Old Quarter has many tailors, Unlim Tailor offers a different level of service.
                                        Located just a 20-minute drive from the Old Quarter at 107 Kim Ma Street, Hanoi, we are a reputable tailor specializing in bespoke, high-end suits with thousands of fabric options.
                                        Our approach is private, sophisticated, and focused on those who need more than just a suit—they need an image that reflects their status and leadership.
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="accordion-item">
                                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="accordionQuestionHeader2">
                                    <button class="accordion-button fs-15 fw-normal collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#accordionQuestionBody2">
                                        How can I find a reliable tailor near me in Hanoi?
                                    </button>
                                </h2>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="accordionQuestionBody2">
                                    <div class="accordion-body">
                                        If you're looking for a tailor near me in Hanoi, look no further than Unlim Tailor. We serve international clients and local elites, politicians, and embassies who demand perfection.
                                        Each suit is handcrafted using premium Italian and English fabrics, and we offer a discreet, personalized experience that gentlemen will appreciate from the very first encounter.
